step	1	-	After starting the quest
line	<col=000080>I found a <col=800000>Young Snail</col> on a small island in the <col=800000>Haunted Woods</col>. It seemed lost and afraid. I decided to help it out by gathering it some food. I'll probably be able to find some <col=800000>Leaves</col> for it to eat nearby.</col>
step	2	-	After gathering the leaves
step	3	-	After killing the leech
line	<str>I found a Young Snail on a small island in the Haunted Woods. It seemed lost and afraid. I decided to help it out by gathering it some food.</str>
line	<col=000080>I collected some <col=800000>Leaves</col> from nearby for the <col=800000>Snail</col> to eat. However, upon my return, I found it being attacked by a <col=800000>Leech</col>. I was able to quickly defeat it, but not before the <col=800000>Snail</col> was injured. I'll need to search nearby to find something to use as a <col=800000>Balm</col> to heal the <col=800000>Snail</col> with.</col>
step	4	-	After collecting dew
line	<str>I found a Young Snail on a small island in the Haunted Woods. It seemed lost and afraid. I decided to help it out by gathering it some food.</str>
line	<col=000080>I collected some <col=800000>Leaves</col> from nearby for the <col=800000>Snail</col> to eat. However, upon my return, I found it being attacked by a <col=800000>Leech</col>. I was able to quickly defeat it, but not before the <col=800000>Snail</col> was injured. I searched nearby and found some <col=800000>Dew</col>. I should use it to heal the <col=800000>Snail</col>.</col>
step	5	-	After healing the snail
step	6	-	After naming the snail
line	<str>I found a Young Snail on a small island in the Haunted Woods. It seemed lost and afraid. I decided to help it out by gathering it some food.</str>
line	<str>I collected some Leaves from nearby for the Snail to eat. However, upon my return, I found it being attacked by a Leech. I was able to quickly defeat it, but not before the Snail was injured. I searched nearby and found some Dew which I was able to heal the Snail with.</str>
line	<col=000080>I decided to give the <col=800000>Snail</col> a name: <col=800000>[snail name]</col>. It seemed happy with my choice. I should see how it's doing now.</col>
step	7	-	Building a snail shelter
line	<str>I found a Young Snail on a small island in the Haunted Woods. It seemed lost and afraid. I decided to help it out by gathering it some food.</str>
line	<str>I collected some Leaves from nearby for the Snail to eat. However, upon my return, I found it being attacked by a Leech. I was able to quickly defeat it, but not before the Snail was injured. I searched nearby and found some Dew which I was able to heal the Snail with.</str>
line	<col=000080>I decided to give the <col=800000>Snail</col> a name: <col=800000>[snail name]</col>. It seemed happy with my choice. To better protect <col=800000>[snail name]</col> from danger, I decided to build a shelter. I should hopefully be able to find the materials to do so nearby.</col>
