line	<col=000080>With a shelter built for <col=800000>[snail name]</col>, it seemed like it was time for us to part ways. However, I decided to gather a bit more food first. I collected some more <col=800000>Leaves</col>, but upon my return, <col=800000>[snail name]</col> was nowhere to be found. However, someone was there wearing a horrifyingly familiar looking <col=800000>Snelm</col>. There is only one path ahead of me now. They must die.</col>
