done	<str>With a shelter built for [snail name], it seemed like it was time for us to part ways. However, I decided to gather a bit more food first. I collected some more Leaves, but upon my return, [snail name] was nowhere to be found. However, someone was there wearing a horrifyingly familiar looking Snelm. At that point, I did the only thing I could. I killed them. I can never undo what happened, but I can take some small solace in the fact that justice was served.</str>
